        "r": 164.69100000000003,
        "b": 578.5413344167462
      },
      "content": "Switch the oven on and record the Serial Number. Check the firmware is correct, update if older version is observed (select the 'cog' to enter settings)."
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "id": "fig_0396",
      "reading_order": 1937,
      "section": "Task B",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 186.18715050673316,
        "t": 775.8674318711555,
