      },
      "image_path": "figures/figure_0400.png",
      "previous_block_id": "txt_1480",
      "next_block_id": "txt_1481"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1481",
      "reading_order": 1949,
      "section": "Task B",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 431.75999999999993,
        "t": 481.86601953125,
        "r": 545.097,
        "b": 400.2213344167461
      },
      "content": "In diagnostic view select/operate each component to check operation, as detailed in the visual view section 5.2. Check all speed ranges of the fans."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_1482",
      "reading_order": 1950,
      "section": "Task B",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 431.7599999999999,
        "t": 396.0690195312499,
        "r": 533.343,
        "b": 363.5013344167461
      },
      "content": "Record microwave (individual & combined) current draws."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_1483",
      "reading_order": 1951,
      "section": "Task B",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 431.751,
        "t": 359.1060195312499,
        "r": 541.731,
        "b": 351.0183344167461
      },
      "content": "Record displayed Voltage."
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "id": "fig_0401",
      "reading_order": 1952,
      "section": "Task B",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 310.12189223462354,
        "t": 308.4540966450461,
        "r": 556.784608633954,
        "b": 209.2980000490537
      },
      "image_path": "figures/figure_0401.png",
      "previous_block_id": "txt_1483",
      "next_block_id": "txt_1484"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1484",
      "reading_order": 1953,
      "section": "Task B",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 43.56,
        "t": 194.70601953125004,
        "r": 316.26,
        "b": 137.52168579079193
      },
      "content": "Finally, remove the bowl of water from inside the cavity and select the recommission test (if the recommission test is greyed out, it means the oven is above the desired temperature and the function is disabled). Follow the onscreen instructions and record result."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1485",
      "reading_order": 1954,
      "section": "Task B",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 43.31099999999998,
        "t": 121.02901953125001,
        "r": 178.86,
        "b": 76.22133441674623
      },
      "content": "Come out of the service and setting modes. Pre-heat the oven and cook one item of food from the operators' menu."
    },
